  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CFA - loan - Corporacion Financiera Am</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gr&#xf6;n Fond, Centralam. l&#xe5;n</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conditional loan to swedfund for their investment in a venture capital fund namned CFA (corporacion financiera ambiental s.a). The fund should invest in comercial and inviromental projects in central america. Swedfund holds shares to a value of USD 1 000 000. Repayment to Sida depends on the return on shares or when the fund sells off thier investments.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Villkorsl&#xe5;n via Swedfund f&#xf6;r vidare investering i venturecapital bolaget CFA (corporacion financiera ambiental s.a) f&#xf6;r investering i komersiellt och milj&#xf6;m&#xe4;ssigt intressanta projekt i centralamerikanska l&#xe4;nder. Swedfund har aktier till ett v&#xe4;rde av USD  1 000 000. &#xc5;terbetalning till sida n&#xe4;r utdelning eller avveckling sker i fonden.</narrative>
  </description>
